    <ol>

        <li class="recipe-steps-item" id="recipe-step1"><div class="recipe-steps-content"><span class="recipe-steps-position">1</span><div class="recipe-steps-text is-wysiwyg"><p>Em uma panela de press&atilde;o coloque o &oacute;leo e a cebola, deixe at&eacute; que ela fique bem moreninha.</p>
</div>
                </div>
            </li><li class="recipe-steps-item" id="recipe-step2"><div class="recipe-steps-content"><span class="recipe-steps-position">2</span><div class="recipe-steps-text is-wysiwyg"><p>Junte a carne cortada em cubos m&eacute;dios, deixe dourar por 15 minutos.</p>
</div>
                </div>
            </li><li class="recipe-steps-item" id="recipe-step3"><div class="recipe-steps-content"><span class="recipe-steps-position">3</span><div class="recipe-steps-text is-wysiwyg"><p>Junte os 2 cubos de caldo natural e o colorau a gosto.</p>
</div>
                </div>
            </li><li class="recipe-steps-item" id="recipe-step4"><div class="recipe-steps-content"><span class="recipe-steps-position">4</span><div class="recipe-steps-text is-wysiwyg"><p>Coloque a &aacute;gua at&eacute; que cubra a carne, mas n&atilde;o ultrapasse a carne.</p>
</div>
                </div>
            </li><li class="recipe-steps-item" id="recipe-step5"><div class="recipe-steps-content"><span class="recipe-steps-position">5</span><div class="recipe-steps-text is-wysiwyg"><p>Coloque na press&atilde;o por 25 minutos.</p>
</div>
                </div>
            </li><li class="recipe-steps-item" id="recipe-step6"><div class="recipe-steps-content"><span class="recipe-steps-position">6</span><div class="recipe-steps-text is-wysiwyg"><p>Retire do fogo, tire a press&atilde;o e junte as batatas e o cheiro-verde.</p>
</div>
                </div>
            </li><li class="no-print u-hidden-desk"><div
        class="ad-placement ads-pholder ads-pholder-incontent ads-pholder-incontent1_mobile no-print ads-only-mobile ads-with-title"data-title="Publicidade"><div id="dfp-incontent1_mobile"
        data-position="incontent"
        data-device="mobile"
        class="ads ad-item u-align-center no-print"
        style="font:0/0 a;"></div></div></li><li class="recipe-steps-item" id="recipe-step7"><div class="recipe-steps-content"><span class="recipe-steps-position">7</span><div class="recipe-steps-text is-wysiwyg"><p>Coloque na press&atilde;o novamente, conte 5 minutos ap&oacute;s a panela de press&atilde;o come&ccedil;ar a apitar e desligue o fogo.</p>
</div>
                </div>
            </li></ol>
